    "faq": {
      "type": "sf-pdp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Results",
            "icon": "trend",
            "question": "When will I actually notice something?",
            "answer": "<p>The first thing you notice is the fit: the 3D texture and the high waist smooth and support your shape the moment you put them on. Anything beyond that depends on your body, your size and how you wear them, so we don't promise a timeline. Here is a simple way to get to know your leggings:</p>",
            "open": true,
            "show_steps": true
          }
        },
        "q-2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "You put it on. Not convinced yet.",
            "label": "Day 1",
            "icon": "smile"
          }
        },
        "q-3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Your husband notices. You don't believe him.",
            "label": "Day 7",
            "icon": "chat"
          }
        },
        "q-4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Your girlfriends notice too.",
            "label": "Day 14",
            "icon": "people"
          }
        },
        "q-5": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Your kids can tell something changed.",
            "label": "Day 30",
            "icon": "hands"
          }
        },
        "q-6": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "You look in the mirror, and you smile.",
            "label": "Day 60",
            "icon": "smile"
          }
        },
        "q-7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "How it works",
            "icon": "sparkle",
            "question": "Why would a legging change anything about cellulite?",
            "answer": "<p>A legging cannot remove cellulite, and we would never say it can. What it does is change how your silhouette looks while you wear it: the 3D texture and the high-waist fit gently smooth and support the area, so your skin looks more even under your clothes.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false,
            "card_1_icon": "calendar",
            "card_1_title": "Nothing to book",
            "card_1_text": "No appointment, no clinic, no waiting room.",
            "card_2_icon": "clock",
            "card_2_title": "Nothing to add to your day",
            "card_2_text": "You put them on. Walking does the rest.",
            "card_3_icon": "shield",
            "card_3_title": "Nothing to lose",
            "card_3_text": "30 days to try them and decide for yourself."
          }
        },
        "q-8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Daily wear",
            "icon": "clock",
            "question": "Can I wear them all day, every day?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. They are designed for everyday comfort, from errands to the office to a lazy weekend. Choose the size that feels snug but never restrictive, and wash them between wears like any other leggings.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false
          }
        },
        "q-9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Cellulite types",
            "icon": "search",
            "question": "Will it do anything for my kind of cellulite?",
            "answer": "<p>Cellulite comes in different forms and most women have a mix. A legging does not treat any of them: it gives the same smoothing look to all of them while you wear it.</p><p><strong>The honest part:</strong> if you are looking for a treatment, talk to a health professional. If you want leggings that make you feel good in your clothes every day, that is exactly what these are for. Here is how they compare with the usual options:</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false,
            "table_cols": "Essabar&Co., Anti-cellulite cream, Salon massage, Standard leggings",
            "table_rows": "Works without an appointment | yes, yes, no, yes\nNo extra time in your day | yes, no, no, yes\nWear it anywhere, all day | yes, no, no, yes\n3D texture knit | yes, no, no, no\nOne-off cost | yes, no, no, yes"
          }
        },
        "q-10": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Life changes",
            "icon": "heart",
            "question": "Pregnancy, menopause, weight changes: still relevant?",
            "answer": "<p>Our sizes run from S to 5XL, so you can pick the size that fits you today and change it later if your body changes. Free returns within 30 days make it easy to find the right one.</p><p>These are everyday leggings, not maternity or medical garments. If you are pregnant or have a medical condition (circulation, skin), ask your doctor before wearing any shaping garment.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false
          }
        },
        "q-11": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Care",
            "icon": "drop",
            "question": "How do I wash them without ruining the weave?",
            "answer": "<p>Fabric softener and heat can dull the 3D texture and shorten the life of your leggings. A gentle wash and air drying keep it looking its best.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false,
            "dont_title": "Don't",
            "dont_list": "Fabric softener\nTumble dryer\nIroning the 3D lines",
            "do_title": "Do",
            "do_list": "Machine wash at 30°C\nTurn them inside out\nAir dry flat or hanging"
          }
        },
        "q-12": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "tag": "Sizing",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "question": "What happens if I pick the wrong size?",
            "answer": "<p>No stress: returns are free within 30 days. Send them back and order the size that suits you better.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "show_steps": false,
            "callout_title": "Between two sizes? Take the larger one.",
            "callout_text": "A legging that is too tight is uncomfortable and wears out faster. You want snug, never restrictive. Not sure? Use the “View in my size” button next to the price."
          }
        }
      },
